{"data": [{"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:07:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113286001476935854"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/dlacalle_IA/st…", "end": 128, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/dlacalle_IA/status/2113152460634415115", "start": 105, "url": "https://t.co/A0Y9ZKZUaU"}]}, "id": "2113286001476935854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3031, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113152460634415115", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Media should go back 6 months &amp; identify the talking heads who were trying to guide funds into them. https://t.co/A0Y9ZKZUaU", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113286001476935854"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113280207985516544"]}, "author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:43:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113280211584167982"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "By merging the wavelength-independent geometry of reflection with the momentum control of a periodic lattice, a deep binary grating efficiently routes multiple distinct wavelengths into a single diffraction angle.", "display_url": "go.aps.org/47uJjoG", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://go.aps.org/47uJjoG", "images": [{"height": 200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113280214683840512/r9WNDVHv?format=png&name=orig", "width": 200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113280214683840512/r9WNDVHv?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 249, "status": 200, "title": "Reflection-Assisted Discrete Achromatic Diffraction", "unwound_url": "https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/3ss4-c6dw", "url": "https://t.co/Sil5omLIbv"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/0oXGkEku5L", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2113280211584167982/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113280207985516544", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/0oXGkEku5L"}]}, "id": "2113280211584167982", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 2361, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "By merging reflection’s wavelength-independent geometry with the momentum control of a periodic lattice, a deep binary grating efficiently routes wavelengths into a single diffraction angle. The observation could help build flat optical components: https://t.co/Sil5omLIbv https://t.co/0oXGkEku5L", "url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2113280211584167982"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:22:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113274827754615281"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 279, "start": 273, "tag": "China"}]}, "id": "2113274827754615281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 4549, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "“It’s very clear why SK has proposed this deal. The Chinese are pressuring them,” said Leland Miller, who serves on the U.S.-China Economic &amp; Security Review Commission, a 12-person body formed in 2000 to advise Congress on national security concerns involving trade w/#China.", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113274827754615281"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113271992883327223"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/julien_grossot…", "end": 153, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/julien_grossot/status/2112962900356628573", "start": 130, "url": "https://t.co/rJXj0M6Xnf"}]}, "id": "2113271992883327223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 28433, "like_count": 218, "quote_count": 16, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112962900356628573", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I was at that concert. It was extraordinary. Bowie also sang Heroes (“we can be Heroes, just for one day”). Not a dry eye at MSG. https://t.co/rJXj0M6Xnf", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2113271992883327223"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:10:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113271730554703930"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 116, "id": "23922797", "start": 107, "username": "SCMPNews"}], "urls": [{"description": "Jim Himes claims ‘slowing dispersion of advanced chips into China’ essential for Washington in global tech race as US midterm elections near.", "display_url": "sc.mp/jnpze?utm_sour…", "end": 102, "expanded_url": "https://sc.mp/jnpze?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=3371692&utm_medium=share_widget", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113031951833518080/sFQAOexX?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113031951833518080/sFQAOexX?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 79, "title": "Top Democrat says chip restrictions are ‘key lever’ for US AI edge over China", "unwound_url": "https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3371692/top-democrat-says-chip-restrictions-are-key-lever-us-ai-edge-over-china?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=3371692&utm_medium=share_widget", "url": "https://t.co/XbOPkpivvh"}]}, "id": "2113271730554703930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 3877, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Top Democrat says chip restrictions are ‘key lever’ for US AI edge over China\n https://t.co/XbOPkpivvh via @scmpnews Himes gets it", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2113271730554703930"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:59:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113268901803065477"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2113262221975564297", "start": 209, "url": "https://t.co/CmwJURR0k5"}]}, "id": "2113268901803065477", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 22281, "like_count": 132, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113262221975564297", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Weird, everyone's saying that the rate decline has to do with prospect of an AI slowdown. And yet on the way up, everyone was saying the market was freaking out about the size of the debt. Make it make sense! https://t.co/CmwJURR0k5", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113268901803065477"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:58:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113268712971161863"], "id": "2113268712971161863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 12655, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "\"On the diplomatic front, Lai has been unable to visit Latin America and the Caribbean — where the largest number of Taiwan’s allies are — because the Trump administration has refused to allow him to transit through the region as it pursues trade and other deals with China.\"", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2113268712971161863"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:53:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113267603435082050"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ReutersChina/s…", "end": 54, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ReutersChina/status/2113186130640154838", "start": 31, "url": "https://t.co/MWU6urkeDw"}]}, "id": "2113267603435082050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1931, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113186130640154838", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Sometimes they just say stuff. https://t.co/MWU6urkeDw", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113267603435082050"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113265249096708096"]}, "author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:45:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113265593092628551"], "entities": {"urls": [