113096780208320757", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Another generation of \"chives\" is unfortunately learning the expensive lesson that for all but a relatively few insiders, investing in A-shares is more wealth destructing than wealth creating. Not helpful for confidence https://t.co/vGSwL5dZbv", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2113262970381733929"}, {"attachments": {"poll_ids": ["2113262220272422912"]}, "author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:32:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113262221975564297"], "id": "2113262221975564297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 31447, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Why are rates lower today. But why? \n\nSudden outbreak of fiscal optimism? \n\nMaybe overnight, people started feeling really good about the future of America? \n\nOr is it the slowing AI trade, and its implications for slower growth and lower inflation?", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113262221975564297"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:18:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113258679877202406"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 1, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"description": "China’s CSI 300 index sheds 1.8% and European equities fall", "display_url": "ft.com/content/6e318b…", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/6e318b81-a771-4842-9754-e265fef2852f", "images": [{"height": 394, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113184050865467392/huRSfoTG?format=png&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113184050865467392/huRSfoTG?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 191, "status": 200, "title": "Global stocks tumble as oil prices rise", "unwound_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/6e318b81-a771-4842-9754-e265fef2852f", "url": "https://t.co/wqasZrkXId"}]}, "id": "2113258679877202406", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1600, "li